  "description": "A large-scale coup d’état took place in Arenbar, the Land of the Golden Tree. Evon Lake, the leader of the rebels and a knight who had served as the late king’s closest bodyguard, sought to atone for his sins by sacrificing his own life, but a man who suddenly appeared at the execution site cut the rope, saving him from death.\n\nBy the hand of the missing prince, ‘Marsagar Sagrund’, whom he had sent away as a hostage.\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/black_steed)",
